(inv) Stock and prices for the shop floor.
Documented commands (type help <topic>):
----------------------------------------
EOF  add  columns  help  history  list  ping  quit  remove  set  total

Miscellaneous help topics:
--------------------------
pricing

Undocumented commands:
----------------------
complete  shell  show

(inv) add NAME QTY [PRICE] -- see also: help pricing
(inv) set NAME qty|price VALUE        (changes one field)
(inv) Total value of the stock.

Each item counts quantity times price.
(inv)         
(inv) *** No help on show
(inv) *** No help on nosuch
(inv) Prices are in dollars with at most two decimals: 3, 3.5, 3.50.
(inv) End of input ends the session.
(inv) List available commands with "help" or detailed help with "help cmd".
(inv) columns WIDTH WORD...: lay the words out as help does.
(inv) Show the lines read so far, across sessions.
(inv) Remove an item entirely: remove NAME
(inv) Leave the console.
(inv) *** No help on complete
(inv) *** No help on add extra
(inv) list [PREFIX]: items in name order, with quantity and price
